ed to the resource file. And the resource file keeps the old script name, that causes problems in script and editor itself.\n\n```\n [gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"MY_RESOURCE_SCRIPT\" load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://dg1arq1spnk31\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://d2os04fnwm6g7\" path=\"res://MY_RESOURCE_SCRIPT_RENAMED.gd\" id=\"1_6pi7m\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_6pi7m\")\n_test = false\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821740786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821768617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105643#issuecomment-2821768617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105643","id":2821768617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oMMWp","user":{"login":"TypeOverride","id":2394124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTQxMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2394124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride","html_url":"https://github.com/TypeOverride","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TypeOverride/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site